r rebrand the binder. SET & PROPS: Hospital maintenance workshop (IPSRS) in the morning: metal shelves with labeled spare-part boxes, a workbench with a multimeter and a medical infusion pump opened for service, a wall-mounted red fire extinguisher, a small desk with a laptop and a thin worn folder. Fluorescent light mixed with daylight from a high window. Any other people appear only as a blurred shoulder at frame edge. No readable text anywhere. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Product reveal · He places the package binder on the desk beside the laptop and rests a hand on it. VO (ID, verbatim): "Sekarang saya pakai paket ini." Delivery (EN): relieved, steady. 2–4s Product demo · Over-the-shoulder to the laptop: the calibration tracker sheet with red, yellow and green status cells; he points at one cell. VO (ID, verbatim): "Status kalibrasi langsung kelihatan warnanya." Delivery (EN): clear, matter-of-fact. 4–6s Product demo · Top-down close-up: hands open the binder to a printed fire extinguisher inspection sheet. VO (ID, verbatim): "Inspeksi APAR juga ada lognya." Delivery (EN): practical. 6–8s Product demo · He hands a printed SOP sheet to a blurred colleague at the frame edge. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tim tinggal ikut prosedurnya." Delivery (EN): warm, confident. 8–10s Product detail · 45-degree close-up of the binder and laptop side by side on the desk. VO: none. AUDIO: Soft hum of fluorescent lights and a distant hospital corridor. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly sync